From 1abe473513d4dd48837a91c15852f725d439d3be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:29:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): merge linked-card running into session dot
 [daveey]

Use the existing working circle for linked running cards as well as agent
activity. Remove the separate lead square in both sidebar layouts. Preserve
needs-input/unread precedence and the trailing cluster's exclusion of blue.
Other dot surfaces default to zero linked cards; no store/reducer changes.

Proof: red-first 11 failures with 79 passing controls; green 93 vitest files,
1172 tests. Full Desktop tsc and touched-file eslint pass. scripts/check
--base origin/main passes all 21 checks including health. i18n key inventory
regenerated and verified after removing unused cardsIdle copy.
